Activate the fixed USB Serial/JTAG CDC IN endpoint when the browser
Cardputer-ADV session supplies its explicit USB output chardev. Keep the
native 0173/0177 implementation of the FIFO, IRQ and virtual host timing.

UART0/1 remain distinct. The host receives device-to-host data only.
Other ESP32-S3 boards keep the inactive controller without a chardev.

